values ('33333333-3333-3333-3333-100000000002', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'intro', 'What does the acronym SOUP stand for in IEC 62304?', '["Software of Unknown Provenance", "System of Unverified Programming", "Source of Unqualified Products", "Software of Undefined Process"]'::jsonb, 0, 'SOUP is Software of Unknown Provenance — pre-existing software not developed under IEC 62304, such as open-source libraries, operating systems, or commercial off-the-shelf components.', 2)
