values ('33333333-3333-3333-3333-100000000003', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'intro', 'Documenting the detailed design of each software unit (§5.4.2) is required for which safety class?', '["Class A only", "Class B and C", "Class C only", "All classes"]'::jsonb, 2, '§5.4.2 to §5.4.4 — the detailed design of each software unit, the design of its interfaces, and verification of that design — are assigned to Class C alone. Note that Clause 5.4 as a whole does reach Class B, because §5.4.1 (subdivide the software until it is represented by software units) is Class B and C. Class A has no Clause 5.4 requirement, and no Clause 5.3 architectural design requirement either.', 3)
