values ('33333333-3333-3333-3333-100000000008', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'intro', 'Integration test plans and records are explicitly required for which safety classes?', '["Class A only", "Class A and B", "Class B and C", "All classes equally"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Every requirement in Clause 5.6 is assigned to Class B and C, as is the integration test planning requirement in §5.1.5. Class A has no Clause 5.6 requirement at all — not a reduced one.', 8)
on conflict (id) do update set question = excluded.question, options = excluded.options, correct_index = excluded.correct_index, explanation = excluded.explanation, sort_order = excluded.sort_order;

