values ('33333333-3333-3333-3333-100000000010', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'intro', 'When a change request is received for released software, what is the first required action?', '["Immediately implement the fix and retest", "Analyse the change for potential safety impact", "Archive the current released version", "Update the software requirements specification"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Under Clause 6, every change to released software must first be analysed to determine its impact on safety and the scope of additional verification and validation required.', 10)
