values ('33333333-3333-3333-3333-100000000012', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'intro', 'What minimum information must be documented when a manufacturer uses SOUP?', '["The SOUP''s complete source code", "The title, manufacturer, and version of the SOUP", "The SOUP''s full validation test history", "The SOUP''s patent and licensing status"]'::jsonb, 1, 'IEC 62304 requires that SOUP be identified by its title, manufacturer, and version so it can be tracked as a configuration item and its known anomalies can be evaluated.', 12)
