values ('33333333-3333-3333-3333-100000000013', '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222', 'intro', 'Which class of medical device software has the most comprehensive IEC 62304 requirements?', '["Class A", "Class B", "Class C", "All classes have identical requirements"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Class C imposes the most stringent requirements, including detailed design documentation, rigorous unit testing, and complete traceability — reflecting the highest potential severity of harm.', 13)
